# 32. Kubernetes in AWS EKS

Traditional Kubernetes:

```text
You manage:

Control Plane

+

Worker Nodes
```

EKS:

```text
AWS manages:

Control Plane


You manage:

Worker Nodes

Applications
```

Architecture:

```text
AWS EKS

        Control Plane
              |
              |
        Worker Nodes
              |
              |
             Pods
```

